OL,3,GNEWSAGranddad, 82, to take on 10k as
OL,4,Apart of family team
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 82-year-old grandfather is set to be
OL,7,Fthe oldest charity runner at this
OL,8,Fyear's annual Run Cheltenham 10k race.
OL,10,FDave Cant, from Cheltenham, will run
OL,11,Falongside his two daughters, son-in-law
OL,12,Fand grandchildren to raise money for
OL,13,FSue Ryder, the palliative care and
OL,14,Fbereavement charity he has volunteered
OL,15,Fwith for 17 years.
OL,17,FHe will be one of thousands of people
OL,18,Fto take part in the annual event, which
OL,19,Foffers a half marathon, 10k race and
OL,20,Fone mile run, at Prestbury Park in
OL,21,FCheltenham on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
