OL,3,GNEWSAGranddad, 82, to take on 10k as
OL,4,Apart of family team
OL,5,
OL,6,FCant said the race was about "family,
OL,7,Ftogetherness, determination, and
OL,8,Fsupporting the incredible work carried
OL,9,Fout by Sue Ryder, whose hospice care
OL,10,Fand compassion mean so much to families
OL,11,Ffacing difficult times".
